-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9cf7676\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"372\">Quang Anh Billiard \u2013 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01a1n thu\u1ea7n l\u00e0 nh\u00e0 ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i c\u01a1 bi-a v\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 n\u01a1i ti\u1ebfp l\u1eeda \u0111am m\u00ea cho c\u00e1c b\u1ea1n tr\u1ebb tr\u00ean h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh chinh ph\u1ee5c nh\u1eefng \u0111\u1ec9nh cao trong b\u1ed9 m\u00f4n bi-a.<\/p><p data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"630\">Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 b\u00e1n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n b\u00e1n s\u1ef1 <strong data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"432\">UY T\u00cdN<\/strong> v\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"446\">AN T\u00c2M<\/strong>.<br data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"450\" \/>Ni\u1ec1m tin c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi Quang Anh Billiard l\u00e0 th\u00e0nh qu\u1ea3 c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh d\u00e0i n\u1ed7 l\u1ef1c kh\u00f4ng ng\u1eebng ngh\u1ec9, v\u1edbi kim ch\u1ec9 nam l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"629\">l\u1ea5y kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng l\u00e0m trung t\u00e2m, \u0111\u1eb7t ch\u1eef T\u00cdN l\u00ean h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u<\/strong>.<\/p><p data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"812\">T\u1ea1i Quang Anh Billiard, b\u1ea1n ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 y\u00ean t\u00e2m v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"711\">ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch b\u1ea3o h\u00e0nh r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng<\/strong>, minh b\u1ea1ch \u2013 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o quy\u1ec1n l\u1ee3i t\u1ed1i \u0111a cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng khi l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-065329c e-fle